@subsection Debugging Techniques

@strong{SMALLTALK Debugging:}

Smalltalk provides extensive debugging facilities through interactive development environment:

@example
self halt.                    " Breakpoint - drop into debugger "
Transcript show: variable; cr. " Output to transcript "
(x isKindOf: Number) ifFalse: [self error: 'X must be numeric'].
@end example

@strong{MUDDLE Debugging:}

@example
<PRINT "Debug: " .VARIABLE>
<COND
  ((<> .RESULT 'ok> 
   <PROGN <PRINT "Error: " (CAR .RESULT)> <RETURN>)
>
@end example

@strong{LINGO Debugging:}

@example
put "Debug: value=" & value
if debug then
  put "Detailed trace: " & variable
end if
@end example

